### List issues
GET {{githubBaseUrl}}/repos/{{githubUser}}/{{githubRepo}}/issues?state=open&per_page=10
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
User-Agent: {{githubUserAgent}}

### Create issue
@issueTitle=Test HTTP
@issueBody=HTTP Client Request

POST {{githubBaseUrl}}/repos/{{githubUser}}/{{githubRepo}}/issues
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
User-Agent: {{githubUserAgent}}
{
  "title": "{{issueTitle}}",
  "body": "{{issueBody}}"
}

### Close issue
@issueNumber=2

PATCH {{githubBaseUrl}}/repos/{{githubUser}}/{{githubRepo}}/issues/{{issueNumber}}
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{githubToken}}
User-Agent: {{githubUserAgent}}
{
  "state": "closed"
}